WEBVTT

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.620
Ikaruga-san...

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.080
I've delayed it for so long,

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.660
but I'll finally tell you today...

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.620
I'll tell you my feelings.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.880
I'll hand it to her in person so it won't turn out like last time.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.300
Please accept this letter I wrote overnight...

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.380
This love letter!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.590
Washizu-kun...

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.260
Hurry up.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.680
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:01.600
It doesn't matter when

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.500
The single word that I couldn't say

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:17.700
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:21.180
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.920
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:28.670
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.530
I will always be your side

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:38.410
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:41.970
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:47.640
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:52.500
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:52.300 --> 00:02:02.430
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:02.430
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:07.880
In the same world

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:23.160
Eighth Longsword

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:23.160
YOU did have fault that time

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.210
Stupid, that's not it.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.120
Hey, isn't that guy...

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.420
That's...

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.920
Washizu of Yokkou Highschool!

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.380
Who?

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.920
You seriously don't know about him?

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.970
He's the strongest delinquent in this city.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.970
He'd easily ditch or go late to class.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.180
A lone wolf who's heartless and cruel.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:47.180
I heard he'll beat you up for talking to him, even if you're really young or old.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.100
Seriously?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.520
Excuse me.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:54.940
How can I get to this place?

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.280
Gramps, watch out!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.440
Run away!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.570
Take the left at that corner, and you're there.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.080
Oh, thank you so much, grandma.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.580
Safety first, gramps.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.040
Wassan!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.830
Sorry for making you wait!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.380
You're seriously late, Torigaya!

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:15.130
Ikaruga-san's gonna hate me if I'm late.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.170
Oh, we still have plenty of time.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.550
Let's go stop by the corner store.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:22.430
Geez, you're always so...

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.180
Is he... a bit different from the rumors?

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.600
No way, a new flavor?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.100
Know when to stop, Torigaya.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.360
You're...

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.950
If I remember correctly, Ikaruga-san's...

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:43.530
Second eldest.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:50.960
Let go!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.330
This is my favorite!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.580
Same for me!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.920
I had my hand on it first!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.340
Haven't you heard of "ladies first"?

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.420
You incompetent delinquent!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.930
Wh-What part of me's incompetent?!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.800
You were dying from doing push-ups the other day.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.760
You're so lame.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.310
That has nothing to do with this.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.930
This is my favorite drink.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.140
That would be my line!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.190
I like it way more than you do, dumbass!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.230
Then put some meaning to those words, Mr. Useless!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:22.110
I like it <i>this</i>  much!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.490
Hey, that's not fair!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.700
What was that?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.120
That's Washizu... right?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.000
Then who's that girl?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.960
Take a picture.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:33.920
Yes, sir.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.750
You useless bastard!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.880
Hey, take that back!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.800
Okay, break time.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.800
Let's take a little break and eat lunch.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.800
Okay.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.310
It's my chance.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.020
The letter...

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:52.600
Washizu-kun.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.520
Yes?

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.190
Your footwork looks much better.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.230
You work very hard.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.560
Oh, thank you.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.230
Umm...

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.070
Umm... U-Umm...

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.700
Lunch will be here any minute, so stay and eat with us.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.450
Yes, thank you.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.580
I couldn't give it to her...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.580
Well, I can do it later.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.620
Nice work, Wassan.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.000
Thanks.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.550
That bitch...

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.670
I'm tired.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.840
I'm hungry.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.090
I've ordered ramen today.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.720
We can all eat together.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.390
Really, we can?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.220
Kids shouldn't need to hold back.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.230
All right!

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.230
I'm so excited.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.390
Thanks.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.110
A towel after he's dripping sweat from his training.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.530
I think this classical way is perfect for a classical guy like Yoichi-san.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.950
That's so cliche these days...

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:48.910
Besides,

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.780
I don't really like that guy!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.410
That behavior is what will put you behind Ibuki-nee.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.920
Ayame-nee, you need to gain points in these simple situations.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.710
That'll hardly get any points...

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.880
Is something wrong, Ayame-dono?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.350
You seem to be drenched with sweat.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.850
You look disgusting.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.600
Wipe it off and get out of my sight, you country-samurai.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.190
She called you a country-samurai.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.360
Does she... hate me so much?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.370
What are you doing?

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.540
Shut up.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.500
Leave me alone.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.210
Leave you alone?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:38.960
What are—

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.580
Shut up, damn it!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.340
Oh, all right.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:47.920
What's this?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.640
Don't look!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.100
Delivering ramen to the Ikaruga Dojo~

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.190
I'll be able to meet that person~

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.610
I'm so happy~

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.030
Hello.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.200
Forget what you saw!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.660
Got it?!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.620
I brought ramen.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.160
It's our little secret, got that?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.620
All right, so get off, dammit! I can't breathe!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.590
The fact that we love each other so deeply...

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.800
must remain a secret.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.670
Yeah.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.680
It's painful for me, but I'll keep it a secret.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.720
Je t'aime.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.220
Aventure.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.810
Bon voyage.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.140
Hey, wait!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.730
What happened?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.150
What was that loud sound?

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.820
Oh, the ramen's here?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.900
Did something happen?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.650
I dunno.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.660
Thank you for the food.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.160
We couldn't find Tsubasa-chan anywhere...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.120
I haven't paid her yet.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.960
I'll go pay her at the restaurant later.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.090
Masashi-kun?

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.300
I haven't drank out of it yet.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.760
But what about yours?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.050
I like hot stuff.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.140
Hot!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.310
What a man.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.940
Wassan, Wassan!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.770
Can I have your pork?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.190
Can I have your naruto?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.650
Damn it, go away. You're so annoying.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.400
That's right!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.320
Wassan's naruto are mine!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.280
You, too, Torigaya!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.120
Don't act like these little kids!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:37.830
Wassan, please?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:38.910
Washizu-dono.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.990
Eh?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.670
You've become much more gentle from when I first met you.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.170
Oh yeah.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:52.670
You don't skip school any more, and you also come to our lessons every time.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.220
W-Well...

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:58.010
Oh yeah, you were pretty infamous in middle school, too, Wassan.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:05.810
The man who single-handedly destroyed the strongest high school delinquent group, Skull Union, in 8th grade.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.860
They say Washizu Ryou is the strongest badass in town.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:09.650
Really?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.820
You don't look like it at all.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.030
How is anyone able to fail so badly?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.490
He doesn't fail!

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.070
He's extremely cool!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.090
They're right, I think...

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.800
I've become really lenient.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.310
Tsubasa-sama.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.140
Tsubasa-sama!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.110
Tsubasa-sama?

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.820
Is something wrong?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.900
You've locked yourself in since you got home.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.030
What in the world happened to her?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.160
Excuse me.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:02.990
Is someone here?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.540
I'm sorry, Angela-dono.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.420
My apologies.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.510
Tsubasa-sama left this at the door?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.470
Was the food safe?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:21.600
Yes.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.970
It was very delicious.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.020
Is that so?

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.140
I'm glad.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:29.980
Wait, why am I blushing?

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.020
Welcome.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.690
Well then, I'll be off.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.610
All right.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.030
Come back any time.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.700
Man, I am hungry.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.780
You know, it's about Washizu...

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.370
Maybe he's fake.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.120
We're talking about <i>that</i>  Washizu, right?

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.880
No, I heard he's been attending school these days.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.460
He even joined a dojo to learn the heart of a martial artist or something.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.340
That can't be true.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:59.050
Washizu, who crushed us, the Skull Union?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.640
So these guys are the Skull Union...

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.760
And that picture to top it off...

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.930
He's become so lame.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.140
Hey, I've been thinking.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.150
Don't you think we can beat Washizu easily now?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.320
Don't be scared.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.360
He's not like how he used to be.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.740
He's got himself an extremely large weakness.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.710
If we beat him, we'll be the strongest again.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.670
Watch out, Washizu.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.690
Bye-bye.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:58.730
See ya.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:11:59.650
Thank you for today.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.030
Okay, see you next time.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.030
Let's go home.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.030
You, too, Washizu-kun.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.030
Yeah.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.450
Good work, today.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.410
Not at all, you even had me for lunch.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.870
Well, I'm going to borrow Kei-chan as an assistant.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:11.750
Kei-chan?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.420
See ya, Wassan.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.420
You?

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.380
Come again, Washizu-kun.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.880
Come again.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:26.890
Yes.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.600
I'm finally done.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.310
I should get in the shower real quick.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.850
Hello.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:34.560
'sup.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.310
It's so easy to get into this house.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.020
Are you stupid?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.270
It's called a dojo.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.530
Is this the girl?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.280
Yeah.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.160
Come with us.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:56.040
Well, I got to talk a lot with Ikaruga-san.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.540
Come again.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.000
Come back, soon.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.750
Come tons of times!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.670
All right, I'll write one again tonight.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.550
Hello.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.890
Washizu of Yokkou.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.390
S-Second eldest?

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.190
What are you doing?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.360
How should I know?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.980
That's what I want to know!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.820
Don't play dumb, Washizu.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.360
You got yourself a pretty cute girlfriend,

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.200
eh, Washizu?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.250
Are you kidding me?!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.620
Who'd like this ugly girl?!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.420
What was that?!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.130
That's my line!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.960
You're just a flat board!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.550
You... good-for-nothing!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.470
When you're only a delinquent!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:45.550
Are you kids?

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.130
Don't play dumb.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:51.390
Then you won't care...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.890
even if I do something to this girl?

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.480
Whoa, there.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.860
You bastard.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.320
Would you look at those eyes?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.570
You're shaken up.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.820
Ikaruga-san, right?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.450
I looked some stuff up about your place.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:14.910
Just four girls and a freeloader are protecting that giant house, right?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:19.420
Wouldn't it suck if people like us barged in and did something like this?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.340
You understand, right, Washizu?

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.380
Be our sandbag.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.340
Stop!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.590
She has nothing to do with this!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.340
Don't move!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:33.970
No!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.350
You heard me, Washizu.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.140
Be our sandbag.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.690
Or else, I'll send pictures of her...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.820
...looking like this to some place.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.990
P-Please stop...

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.780
You bastard.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.990
That's cheap.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.120
Don't make me laugh!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:15:00.420
In fighting, you just gotta win no matter what!

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.130
You used to be like that, didn't you,

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.250
Washizu?!

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.630
Get him!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.560
Don't fight back.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.400
She's gonna get even more nude.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.020
Don't worry, Washizu.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:28.280
People at the dojo will share the same fate soon.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.610
And I can't forget about your pal.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.780
Bird carcass, was it?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.200
Poor bastard.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:41.540
Just for getting mixed up with you, they gotta go through this kind of treatment.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.420
Right?

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.170
I don't care about me!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.920
Fight, you idiot!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.170
Like hell I could do something like...

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.770
You're putting shame on the title of the strongest.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:04.060
You're completely weak compared to the old days when you had no one to lose or protect.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:07.190
You've become so lame, Washizu.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.320
When people have something to protect,

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.320
they become extremely weak!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.120
Something to protect?

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.910
That's right.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.960
I was a lone wolf back then.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.960
I fought to show off my strength.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.050
Then when I noticed...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.010
You're extremely strong.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.930
You want grape juice?

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.970
...I got a pal.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.930
Come to our dojo, Washizu-kun.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.640
I found a girl I like.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.140
I found a place I fit in.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.980
Then I became weak.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:51.240
Because I've been living leniently, these guys are jumping me...

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.030
No!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.570
And I can't even protect a single woman any more.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.410
This is your end!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.960
Wh-Who are you?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.960
Samurai!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.460
It appears that I was wrong.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:14.050
I thought I could see a soothing fight between men.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.350
Does it make you feel good when you win like this?

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.600
You coward!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.100
Remove your hands from Ayame-dono at once!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.400
Sa-Samurai...

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.240
"People become weak when they have something to protect."

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.740
Is that what you said?

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.490
I'm completely right.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.160
This bastard who couldn't do anything but stand there is exactly what I mean!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.250
Have you no eyes?

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.960
He thought about Ayame-dono.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.220
He thought about Torigaya-dono.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.840
He thought about everyone in the dojo.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.220
You say Washizu-dono is weak...

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:04.220
when he still stands after all those blows?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:11.570
In order to protect another, people can unleash so much strength.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.610
People I want to protect?

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.830
I, too, want to protect them.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.130
I'll lend you a hand.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.460
I don't need a hand against these guys.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.380
Let's go, Washizu-dono.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:35.960
Right.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:44.930
Hey...

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.520
Stop...

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.650
Don't you care about the people at the dojo?!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.370
You won't touch them.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.950
Come any time.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.630
Perhaps we overdid it a bit.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.380
Take this, you bastard!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.760
I'm sorry for being so late.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.840
I didn't ask to be helped.

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:24.050
But I must say, I was touched to the core.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.720
As I thought,

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:30.690
you are a wonderful person who can risk his life for his friends, Washizu-dono.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.190
Friends?

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.490
Yoichi-san!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.200
What are you doing?

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.710
I came looking because you—

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.420
Oh, Washizu-kun.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.580
Yes.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.130
Perfect timing.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.840
Did you happen to see Ayame?

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.420
She wasn't at the dojo.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.130
Ayame!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:04.090
Why do you look like that?!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:07.640
Yoichi-san?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.930
What were you doing to Ayame?!

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:11.850
No!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.190
I wasn't doing anything!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.150
It's just a misunderstanding.

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:24.450
He's flirting with Ikaruga-san...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.280
I'm so jealous.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:27.950
Damn it!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.540
You're not my friend!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.170
Washizu-dono.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:37.590
Wait up.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.840
I soaked it with cold water from the sink.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:45.930
Use it.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:53.190
Since... you couldn't fight back because of me.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.230
It was initially all my fault.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.190
Don't try to make me owe you a favor.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.150
Something like that...

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.820
Go give it to that damn samurai!

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.160
Make sure you give it to him this time.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.160
Hey, wait!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.750
What's with him...

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.290
when he's a failure.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.930
Oww.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.220
Hey, Wassan!

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.300
Torigaya?

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.760
Look at this, Wassan.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.720
These are manuscripts for a manga.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.470
I went to get these copy and...

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
What happened to you?!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.480
Oh, I tripped a bit.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.440
Are you all right, Wassan?

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.660
This is nothing.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.410
Wassan...

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.160
Friends, huh?

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.170
Surprisingly...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.920
I don't hate it.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.260
Wassan!

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:06.840
Don't get so close, bastard!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:27.940
I regret not realizing

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:35.510
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:36.490 --> 00:22:43.070
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:52.530
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:56.760
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:56.560 --> 00:23:00.520
Make me hesitate a little

00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:07.510
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:07.390 --> 00:23:11.380
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:15.230
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:17.580
You're not alone

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:21.910
Because I love you

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:26.520
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:30.080
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:37.540
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.650
Next Time!

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:42.400
Hi, what's up?

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:43.940
I'm Yoichi's dad.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:24:08.670
Ninth Technique

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:46.150
Go home with at least that in your brain.

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:49.280
Well, we have lots of customers today, as well.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:50.240
From the end...

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:53.110
Saginomiya, Saginomiya, skip one, then another Saginomiya.

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:56.410
Enemies are everywhere; I'm completely screwed.

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:58.540
Okay, you were supposed to laugh.

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.410
Hey, Yoichi.

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.710
With those hot sisters, it sure feels like summer festival, eh?

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:04.210
How about some for me?

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:06.710
Act like you tripped,

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.460
take their yukata off as you fall, and get beaten up.

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:10.670
Wait, you do that all the time.

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:10.670
Don't miss the next episode!
